# DIT-OS Project Overview

- **Boot path**: Custom bootloader only (no GRUB). Stage1 (512-byte MBR) loads Stage2 from disk; Stage2 shows menu and loads kernel.
- **Layout**: `bootloader/` (stage1, stage2, include/, scripts/), `kernel/` (arch/x86_64/, core/, include/), `scripts/`, `tools/`, `config/`. See PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md and TODO.md.
- **Build**: Bootloader builds via `bootloader/Makefile` → `build/stage1.bin`, `stage2.bin`, `disk.img`. Kernel via `kernel/Makefile` → ELF to `bootloader/build/kernel.bin` for disk image.
- **Conventions**: Prefer existing patterns; add new files to TODO.md when they match PROJECT_STRUCTURE. Use `stdint.h` / `stddef.h` in C/C++; keep assembly in sync with linker script and load addresses.
